.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
# Ignore extdata CONTENTS (not the directory itself: git will not descend into
# an excluded directory, so a `!` negation below would never be reached).
inst/extdata/*
# The frozen normalisation reference is versioned config, not data.
# Comparability across releases and machines depends on everyone using the same
# bounds, so this one file must be tracked.
!inst/extdata/reference_quantiles_2025.csv
# The crisis modifier matrix is likewise methodology, not data: one flag per
# driver and channel, reviewed and versioned with the code.
!inst/extdata/crisis_modifier_matrix.xlsx
.Renviron
countryriskindex.Rcheck/
countryriskindex*.tar.gz
countryriskindex*.tgz
renv/
*.patch

*.png

*.html

reports/disease_clustering_files/

reports/vulcomb_files/
